      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALBERT'S RETURN (7) jumps from box 7 for the first time after placing latest at this track (25.70) in a Grade 5. Comes through a solid form race last start. Good form should continue. ORARA BOB (4) missed the frame last time but had been racing well prior to that, winning a Mix three back before a placing at this track the following run. Can turn it around this time. RITZA ARMANI (5) was a last start winner (25.39) at this track in a Grade 5 and will jump from box 5 for the first time. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. NANGAR ZENA (8) cannot be ruled out.",
